      <TableBody>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>collisionCount</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Count of hash collisions for the DaemonSet. The DaemonSet controller uses this field as a collision avoidance mechanism when it needs to create the name for the newest ControllerRevision.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>conditions</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>array</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Represents the latest available observations of a DaemonSet’s current state.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
