      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>numberAvailable</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>The number of nodes that should be running the daemon pod and have one or more of the daemon pod running and available (ready for at least spec.minReadySeconds)</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
